flowchart TD
    Msg[Patient Utterance] --> Detect{Contains Red-Flag Symptom?}
    
    Detect -->|Severe Bleeding / Syncope / Anaphylaxis| Intercept[Intercept Immediately < 1ms]
    Detect -->|Normal Scheduling or Prep Query| NormalPath[Continue Normal LangGraph Workflow]
    
    Intercept --> BlockTools[Disable All Scheduling & EHR Mutating Tools]
    BlockTools --> CreateTicket[Call create_human_escalation_async in DB]
    CreateTicket --> SetAudit[Log Escalation Audit Event: Urgency EMERGENCY_911]
    SetAudit --> EmergencyMsg[Generate Immediate 911 Directives & Stop Prep Warning]
    EmergencyMsg --> Verifier[OutcomeVerifier Confirms Ticket in DB: CORRECTLY_ESCALATED]
